# af29-lantern — a card a seat was shown stops being shown once it is shuffled away. Alice has Lantern of
# Insight ("Players play with the top card of their libraries revealed. {T}, Sacrifice: Target player
# shuffles."), so both seats are shown bob's top card, Lightning Bolt. She sacrifices it to make bob
# shuffle: nobody may look at any library after that, and the Lightning Bolt alice was shown must leave
# her state. Ten cards, so a shuffle that changes nothing is a one-in-millions chance.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=
humanbattlefield=Lantern of Insight;Mountain
humanlibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
humangraveyard=
aihand=
aibattlefield=Island
ailibrary=Lightning Bolt;Shock;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
aigraveyard=
